# Build-context allowlist for docker/job.Dockerfile.
# azd remote builds (and BuildKit) read <Dockerfile>.dockerignore before the root .dockerignore.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!domains
!skills
!site
# The site's evaluation panel and architecture diagram (site.md §13).
!evals/results/latest.json
!docs/assets/architecture.svg
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
site/.quartz
site/public
